 *   1000 in binary ≈ 1111101000 → 10 bits → MSB at position 9.
 *   __builtin_clzll(1000) = 54 on 64-bit → bucket = 63 − 54 = 9.
 *   Bucket 9 covers [512, 1024) cycles.  Lower bound returned: 2^9 = 512.
